    "body": "Please leave your feedback about new [mini.input](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/readmes/mini-input.html) module here. Feel free to either add new comment or positively upvote existing one.\n\nSome things I am interested to find out (obviously, besides bugs):\n\n- Does it work well out of the box?\n- Is configuration intuitive enough?\n- Are default values of settings convenient for you?\n- Is documentation and examples clear enough?\n\nThanks!",
