            "body": "Ohh ok cool. I understand it now. It was not so obvious to me at first I should have read it again I guess. I taught it was a typo. One last ask, in the cmdline implementation with mini.input is it possible to include / and ? as well along with : in key mappings in the docs? Generally when I look for alternate commandline implementations, I want the cmdline to be in the center of the screen for everything. I believe most of them are the same as well.",
