        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> ... in the cmdline implementation with mini.input is it possible to include / and ? as well along with : in key mappings in the docs? Generally when I look for alternate commandline implementations, I want the cmdline to be in the center of the screen for everything. I believe most of them are the same as well.\n\nYes, it should be possible with some custom scripting. Important to note that Command line implementation is not the main goal of 'mini.input'. It will not handle well all possible scenarios (like command preview, for example). But its capabilities are enough for the basic Command line with completion and highlighting.",
