        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Is there a Normal mode? In [snacks.nvim#input](https://github.com/folke/snacks.nvim/blob/main/docs/input.md), `i_<Esc>` switches to Normal mode, while `n_<Esc>` cancels the input, similar to `CTRL-C`. I can't imagine using a custom input without this feature.",
