        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for making this new module! I've waited so long for this to be able to entirely replace snacks.nvim with mini.nvim (lol). One thing that I would wish for is something similar to Ctrl-f in cmdline mode, which opens up a separate buffer for editing. But after looking at the implementation I'm not sure if that can be done...",
